    "instructions": "Maintain the current agreed project scope in this single Surface. Keep proposed changes separate from the approved baseline. For each change retain its rationale, impacts on deliverables, schedule, resources, budget and risk, decision and source. Never infer approval. Link the original conversation and existing registers; preserve their identities. Use Fields for concise metadata and the titled Rich text objects for detailed content. Required Fields describe expected information; incomplete drafts may be saved. Ask for missing facts when needed; never invent people, dates, references or results. References identify sources and do not grant access. These Fields do not change Workmap execution state.",
